## Scope

Applies to LuminaryWorks MetaRepo and all ecosystem products: DataLuminary, BlockyEdu, DoerFlow, VistaRemote, VistaCast, SyncroBrain (and nested deploy trees).

Re-sync from LuminaryWorks: `pnpm sync:cursor-local-docker-rule`
